{
  "title": "Dua Khatme Quran",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ رَبَّنَا يَا رَبَّنَا تَقَبَّلْ مِنَّا اِنَّكَ اَنْتَ السَّمِيْعُ الْعَلِيْمُ وَ تُبْ عَلَيْنَا اِنَّكَ اَنْتَ التَّوَّابُ الرَّحِيْمُ وَاهْدِنَاۤ اِلَى الْحَقِّ وَ اِلٰى طَرِيْقٍ مُّسْتَقِيْمٍ بِبَرَكَةِ خَتْمِ الْقُرْاٰنِ الْعَظِيْمِ\nALLAAHUMMA RABBANAA YAA RABBANAA TAQABBAL MINNAA INNAKA ANTAS SAMEE-U'L A'LEEM, WA TUB A'LAYNAA INNAKA ANTAT TAWWAABUR RAHEEM, WAHDINAA ILAL HAQQI WA ILAA TAREEQIM MUSTAQEEM BI-BARAKATI KHATMIL QUR-AANIL A'ZEEM\nO Allah our Lord, O our Lord, accept from us — verily You are the All-hearing, the All-knowing — and turn towards us in mercy — verily You are the Oft-relenting, the All-merciful — and guide us to the truth and to a straight path, through the blessing of this completion of the Mighty Qur'an,\nوَاعْفُ عَنَّا يَا كَرِيْمُ وَ اغْفِرْ لَنَا ذُنُوْبَنَا بِفَضْلِكَ وَ جُوْدِكَ وَ كَرَمِكَ يَاۤ اَكْرَمَ الْاَكْرَمِيْنَ وَ يَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nWA A'FU A'NNAA YAA KAREEM WAGHFIR LANAA ZUNOOBANAA BI-FADLIKA WA JOODIKA WA KARAMIKA YAA AKRAMAL AKRAMEEN WA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nand pardon us, O Generous One, and forgive us our sins, by Your bounty, Your munificence, and Your generosity, O most Generous of the generous, O most Merciful of the merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ بَلِّغْ وَ اَوْصِلْ ثَوَابَ مَا قَرَاْنَاهُ بَعْدَ الْقَبُوْلِ مِنَّاۤ اِلٰى رَوْضَةِ نَبِيِّنَا وَ شَفِيْعِنَا مُحَمَّدٍ صَلَّى اللهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ اٰلِهٖ وَ سَلَّمَ وَ اِلٰى رِيَاضِ جَمِيْعِ اَنْبِيَاۤئِكَ وَ رُسُلِكَ وَ اَوْلِيَاۤئِكَ وَ عُلَمَاۤئِكَ وَ صُلَحَاۤئِكَ وَ اَهْلِ طَاعَتِكَ اَجْمَعِيْنَ\nALLAAHUMMA BALLIGH WA AWSIL THAWAABA MAA QARA-NAAHU BA'DAL QABOOLI MINNAA ILAA RAWDATI NABIYYINAA WA SHAFEE-I'NAA MUHAMMADIN SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIHI WA SALLAM, WA ILAA RIYAADI JAMEE-I' ANBIYAAA-IKA WA RUSULIKA WA AWLIYAAA-IKA WA U'LAMAAA-IKA WA SULAHAAA-IKA WA AHLI TAA-A'TIKA AJMA-EEN\nO Allah, convey and deliver the reward of what we have recited — once accepted from us — to the resting-place of our Prophet and our intercessor Muhammad, Allah's blessings and peace be upon him and his Household, and to the resting-places of all Your prophets, Your messengers, Your intimate friends, Your scholars, Your righteous ones, and all who obey You,\nاَللّٰهُمَّ انْصُرِ الْاِسْلَامَ وَ الْمُسْلِمِيْنَ وَ انْصُرْ مَنْ نَصَرَ الدِّيْنَ وَ اخْذُلْ مَنْ خَذَلَ الْمُسْلِمِيْنَ وَ انْصُرْ جُيُوْشَ الْمُسْلِمِيْنَ وَ عَسَاكِرَ الْمُوَحِّدِيْنَ\nALLAAHUMMANSURIL ISLAAMA WAL MUSLIMEEN WANSUR MAN NASARAD DEEN WAKHZUL MAN KHAZALAL MUSLIMEEN WANSUR JUYOOSHAL MUSLIMEENA WA A'SAAKIRAL MUWAHHIDEEN\nO Allah, grant victory to Islam and the Muslims, grant victory to whoever helps the religion, forsake whoever forsakes the Muslims, and grant victory to the armies of the Muslims and the forces of the monotheists,\nوَ اكْتُبِ الصِّحَّةَ وَ السَّلَامَةَ وَ الْعَافِيَةَ عَلَيْنَا وَ عَلَى الْحُجَّاجِ وَ الْغُزَاةِ وَ الْمُسَافِرِيْنَ وَ الْمُقِيْمِيْنَ وَ الْحَاضِرِيْنَ وَ الْغَاۤئِبِيْنَ فِيْ بَرِّكَ وَ بَحْرِكَ مِنْ اُمَّةِ مُحَمَّدٍ صَلَّى اللهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ اٰلِهٖۤ اَجْمَعِيْنَ وَ سَلَامٌ عَلَى الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ وَ الْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nWAKTUBIS SIHHATA WAS SALAAMATA WAL A'AFIYATA A'LAYNAA WA A'LAL HUJJAAJI WAL GHUZAATI WAL MUSAAFIREENA WAL MUQEEMEENA WAL HAADIREENA WAL GHAAA-IBEENA FEE BARRIKA WA BAHRIKA MIN UMMATI MUHAMMADIN SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIHEE AJMA-EEN, WA SALAAMUN A'LAL MURSALEEN, WAL HAMDU LILLAAHI RABBIL A'AALAMEEN\nand decree health, safety, and well-being upon us and upon the pilgrims, the fighters in Your cause, the travelers, the residents, those present and those absent, on Your land and Your sea, from among the nation of Muhammad — Allah's blessings be upon him and his Household, all of them — and peace be upon the messengers, and all praise be to Allah, Lord of the worlds."
